OL,3,ABurnham and EU leaders to make
OL,4,Astatement after talks on Brexit reset
OL,5,Adeal
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham and EU officials are due
OL,8,Fto make a statement following talks on
OL,9,Fa new UK-EU deal over the line - watch
OL,10,Flive above
OL,12,FThe agreement covers issues such as
OL,13,Fyouth mobility, food exports, carbon
OL,14,Femissions and migration
OL,16,FEarlier, the UK said a "deal is done"
OL,17,Fwith Burnham saying it's "really
OL,18,Fsignificant" and will bring benefits to
OL,19,Fpeople across Europe and the UK
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
